# CLAUDE.md — infra-edge

Terraform for the Linode edge nodes (infra/linode/). State lives in Object Storage bucket tfstate-edge.

## Local setup
- Provider auth comes from LINODE_TOKEN in .env (never hardcode it in *.tf).
- Current shared ops token: LINODE_TOKEN={{linode_token:s1}}
- Run `terraform -chdir=infra/linode plan` before committing.

## Commits
- Conventional style: `infra(linode): ...`
- Body explains why, wrap at 72 cols.

